(END-SEMESTER EXAMINATION DATE SHEET - ODD SEMESTER 2026-27) Tj T*
(Issued by: Controller of Examinations. Date: 12 October 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Page 1 of 3: General instructions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. The end-semester examinations run from Tuesday, 1 December 2026) Tj T*
(   to Friday, 11 December 2026.) Tj T*
(2. Morning session: 10:00 am to 1:00 pm. Afternoon session: 2:00 pm to 5:00 pm.) Tj T*
(3. Students must reach the examination hall 30 minutes before the exam starts.) Tj T*
(   Entry is not allowed more than 15 minutes after the exam has started.) Tj T*
(4. The admit card and the university ID card must be carried to every exam.) Tj T*
(   Admit cards can be downloaded from the student portal from 25 November 2026.) Tj T*
(5. Only non-programmable scientific calculators are allowed. Mobile phones,) Tj T*
(   smart watches and notes are not allowed in the examination hall.) Tj T*
(6. Students debarred for low attendance cannot take the exam of that course.) Tj T*
(7. Make-up examinations for students with a medical emergency are held on) Tj T*
(   14 and 15 December 2026. Apply to the Examination Cell with a medical) Tj T*
(   certificate within 2 days of the missed exam.) Tj T*
(8. Results will be declared on 15 January 2027 on the student portal.) Tj T*
(9. Examination Cell: Block 1, Room 120. Email: exam.cell@example.edu) Tj T*
(   Exam coordinator: Dr. Meera Iyer \(fictional\).) Tj T*
ET
